@startuml DSD-CU-08-3
title DSD-CU-08 (3/3) - Añadir/eliminar ítems en listas: endpoints del backend

' Lo que hace el backend en las peticiones de DSD-CU-08 (1/3 y 2/3).
' Fuentes: JwtAuthenticationFilter.java, SecurityConfig.java, ItemListController.java, OwnershipChecker.java,
' ItemListServiceImpl.java, EntityResolver.java, model/ItemList.java, DtoMapper.java, GlobalExceptionHandler.java.
' Diferencias con el guion:
' - La regla es @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN') or @ownership.ownsItemList(#listId, authentication)"),
'   no "@ownershipChecker.isItemListOwner". Una lista inexistente pasa la comprobación y acaba en 404.
' - El 401 y el 403 se deciden antes de llegar al servicio: el filtro deja sin autenticar un token
'   inválido y SecurityConfig responde 401; @PreAuthorize lanza AccessDeniedException -> 403.
' - addItem no usa resolveItemList: usa EntityResolver.findItemList(listId) y el controlador responde
'   con ResponseEntity.of(...): 200 + ItemListDTO, o 404. Un itemId inexistente: resolveItem lanza
'   EntityNotFoundException -> 404.
' - Quitar no usa ItemList.removeItem ni resolveItem: hace list.getItems().removeIf(id == itemId).
'   Responde 200 OK + ItemListDTO (no 204).
!include ../_estilo.iuml

participant "App\n(services)" as app
box "Backend (Spring Boot)" #FFF9F0
    participant "JwtAuthenticationFilter\n<<security>>" as filter
    participant "ItemListController\n<<controller>>\n(@PreAuthorize)" as controller
    participant "ItemListServiceImpl\n<<service>>" as listService
    participant "ItemList\n<<entity>>" as itemList
    participant "ItemListRepository /\nEntityResolver" as listRepo
end box

app -> filter : POST /api/item-lists/{listId}/items/{itemId}\n| DELETE ...(mismo path)\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
filter -> filter : doFilterInternal(): extractUserId, validateToken,\nextractRole -> SecurityContextHolder
alt Token ausente o inválido
    filter --> app : 401 Unauthorized (SecurityConfig)
else Token válido
    filter -> controller : addItem | removeItem(listId, itemId)
    controller -> controller : @PreAuthorize: OwnershipChecker.ownsItemList(listId)
    alt 6a. La lista es de otro usuario
        controller --> app : 403 Forbidden\n(AccessDeniedException -> GlobalExceptionHandler)
    else Es el propietario (o la lista no existe)
        group POST: addItem(listId, itemId) @Transactional
            controller -> listService : addItem(listId, itemId)
            listService -> listRepo : EntityResolver.findItemList(listId)
            alt La lista no existe
                listService --> controller : Optional.empty()
                controller --> app : 404 Not Found
            else La lista existe
                listService -> listRepo : EntityResolver.resolveItem(itemId)
                note right of listRepo : Subtipo polimórfico (Song, Lesson,\nGenre, InstrumentGenre); si no existe:\nEntityNotFoundException -> 404
                listService -> itemList : addItem(item)
                alt 7a. El ítem ya estaba en la lista
                    itemList --> listService : false (se ignora, conserva su posición)
                else Ítem nuevo
                    itemList -> itemList : items.add(item) (al final)
                    itemList --> listService : true
                end
                listService -> listRepo : save(list)
                listService -> listService : DtoMapper.itemListToItemListDto(list)
                listService --> controller : Optional<ItemListDTO>
                controller --> app : 200 OK ItemListDTO
            end
        end
        group DELETE: removeItem(listId, itemId) @Transactional
            controller -> listService : removeItem(listId, itemId)
            listService -> listRepo : EntityResolver.findItemList(listId)
            alt La lista no existe
                controller --> app : 404 Not Found
            else La lista existe
                listService -> itemList : getItems().removeIf(id == itemId)
                listService -> listRepo : save(list)
                listService -> listService : DtoMapper.itemListToItemListDto(list)
                controller --> app : 200 OK ItemListDTO
            end
        end
    end
end

@enduml
